## Rules

- Version is defined in src/version.ts - do not modify without explicit instruction. All work builds toward that version.
- In all interactions and commit messages, be extremely concise and sacrifice grammar for the sake of consision.
- At the end of each plan, give me a list of unresolved questions to answer, if any. Make the questions extremely concise. Sacrifice grammar for the sake of concision.
- When planning, avoid any and all time-based estimates.
